&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131014165721/http:/www.dafont.com/silent-hill.font" title="http://www.dafont.com/silent-hill.font"&gt;http://www.dafont.com/silent-hill.font&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
